      "problem": "Simplify $\\sqrt[3]{125(x+8y)^{3}}.$",
      "worked_solution": "To simplify the expression, we write the term under the radical as a perfect cube, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{125(x+8y)^{3}} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{5(x+8y)\\cdot 5(x+8y)\\cdot 5(x+8y)} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{{(5(x+8y))}^{3}} & = \\\\ 5(x+8y)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
